WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.113
- I can do this.

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:04.635
(cheek making flapping noise)

00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:07.218
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.500
- I regret to say that
the first love letter

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.839
I ever wrote was written
after I had received

00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:16.530
my first love letter and
then that's what inspired me

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.700
to write love letters.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.923
Me and my friend love, which is fitting,

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.920
would write each other letters.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.110
She wrote me a lot more
letters than I wrote her

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.060
but, we would just little things, like,

00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:28.177
"I love you today."

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.620
Or, "I hope you're having a great day."

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:31.757
Or, "Miss you."

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.080
Or, "Just remember you're mine."

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.870
Heart, smiley face or whatever.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.690
It was, you know, cute
little things like that.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:38.523
Just reminders.

00:00:38.523 --> 00:00:40.447
I love candles.
- But what does it smell like?

00:00:40.447 --> 00:00:42.480
- But this candle, it's like a light blue

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.970
which means it's probably sweet

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:44.980
and I don't like sweet candles.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.813
- Wait, you--

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.680
- I want like--
- Hint of lavender?

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.460
- Like a dark rum.
- Oh, okay, okay.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:50.916
- Smell, like, you know?
- More of like a--

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:52.060
- Woodsy.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.649
I've met someone on Instagram

00:00:53.649 --> 00:00:57.960
and like I developed this
ostensibly intimate relationship

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.130
with them and then turns out

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.480
they weren't who they were.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.963
As catfishing does.

00:01:04.209 --> 00:01:07.163
- I think maybe once or
twice they were in the script

00:01:07.163 --> 00:01:10.130
but I say whoa, whoa, whoa
all the time. (laughing)

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.200
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.863
whoa, whoa, whoa, okay, relax.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:17.240
First job was working as a model

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.850
at eight years old out of Miami

00:01:19.907 --> 00:01:23.383
and it was for a Macey's catalog.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.930
I was a little Macey's
baby in the New York Times,

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:29.607
14 years ago. (laughing)

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.760
And then I like dry it
and I just shake it.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.840
Whenever we're doing stuff like this,

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.140
so I can talk to you guys,

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:41.237
there's like this spray,
this sea salt spray.

00:01:41.237 --> 00:01:42.187
Is that what it is?

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.133
Sea salt spray?

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.647
That like makes it look like
I just got out the ocean.

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:47.400
(ocean waves lapping)

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.233
It's all fake.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:49.760
First thing you do when you wake up?

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.020
I go right back to sleep,
it's the first thing I do.

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.860
I cannot wake up and be like, alright,

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:56.230
today's gonna be fantastic.

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:57.403
I wake up and I go, no.

00:01:57.993 --> 00:01:59.313
Not yet.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:02.613
Shantaram by Gregory David Roberts.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.440
The whole book is very poetic

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:09.400
and it's a journey from
deep diving into the abyss

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.680
and then coming back
from it and transcending

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.793
and changing and learning
and it's a beautiful read.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.750
- Do you think you're an extrovert?

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.125
- I charge introvertedly and then I'm like

00:02:22.125 --> 00:02:22.958
(snapping fingers)

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.100
super outgoing.
- Let it out.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.643
- He really has a great
grasp on his personality,

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.273
as we can tell.

